:''Not to be confused with [[Le'Behemoth]].''
'''Elephantidae Papaou''' (超象獣パパオウ, ''Chō Zōjū Papaou'', '''Super Elephant-Beast Papaou''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Le'boin]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

